{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013510/extras/9561868ff2cff3a8f7b1fb0ee007e11f.avif?t=1760028105\" width=654 height=90 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013510/extras/d6a1ccb6d86278df305fa1439e89c598.poster.avif?t=1760028105\" width=654 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013510/extras/d6a1ccb6d86278df305fa1439e89c598.webm?t=1760028105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From summoning rituals to necromancy, true power lies in creation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an Alchemist, a master of the sacred and the profane. Harness ancient knowledge to bend the very laws of nature. Venture into overgrown ruins, seek ingredients in enchanted woods, and learn arcane rites to master the art of <strong>Monster Crafting</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013510/extras/7ff754a88f3051e8b8fe9ff47828b6d8.poster.avif?t=1760028105\" width=654 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013510/extras/7ff754a88f3051e8b8fe9ff47828b6d8.webm?t=1760028105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your creations are more than just combatants; they are vital allies. They will stand with you in battle, retrieve materials from untamed lands, and serve as the foundation for your next, greater invention. The bond you share is the key to unlocking their true potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project is the culmination of a lifelong passion for monster-taming adventures and deep, satisfying crafting systems, finally brought to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013510/extras/9a552b88eacfcfa359dfc212c2fb76d6.avif?t=1760028105\" width=654 height=90 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CREATE, DON'T JUST CATCH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget catching monsters in the wild. Synthesize them from scratch! Combine ingredients, discover new recipes, and bring your unique visions to life. What will you create?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013510/extras/c27756ce7e63bf3f022c3dc44e8d9b81.poster.avif?t=1760028105\" width=654 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013510/extras/c27756ce7e63bf3f022c3dc44e8d9b81.webm?t=1760028105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR MONSTERS ARE YOUR TOOLS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Your creatures are multi-purpose tools. Send them to mine ore, chop wood, or craft potions for you. They level up their gathering skills, making them more efficient and unlocking new resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013510/extras/2ed43aace0d3b721780b3d69a96409bb.poster.avif?t=1760028105\" width=654 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013510/extras/2ed43aace0d3b721780b3d69a96409bb.webm?t=1760028105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FUSE YOUR MONSTERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The alchemy doesn't stop at creation. Fuse your monsters together to create bizarre, powerful, and entirely new species. Discover hidden recipes to unlock every possible combination and create the ultimate team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013510/extras/3b324ba13d8b4479d537d1f8962e49d8.poster.avif?t=1760028105\" width=654 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013510/extras/3b324ba13d8b4479d537d1f8962e49d8.webm?t=1760028105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TACTICAL TURN-BASED COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in strategic battles where victory relies on smart team composition and synergy. Master a rock-paper-scissors system of elemental strengths and weaknesses, and unleash powerful attacks by cleverly pairing your monsters' abilities. Every monster you create is a new tactical piece for your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013510/extras/7e31eb6dfa307d3f8ad7677b39ded256.poster.avif?t=1760028105\" width=654 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013510/extras/7e31eb6dfa307d3f8ad7677b39ded256.webm?t=1760028105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORLD TO EXPLORE\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through diverse, hand-crafted environments, from sunny beaches to haunted graveyards, each filled with secrets to find, resources to gather, and charismatic characters to befriend (or battle).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013510/extras/36c5373fa7e35ff3d33dc22d9e90d32e.poster.avif?t=1760028105\" width=654 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013510/extras/36c5373fa7e35ff3d33dc22d9e90d32e.webm?t=1760028105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A HEARTFUL ADVENTURE\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a world-shaping lore where the lines between gods, monsters, and alchemists blur. Discover the ancient myths of creation, the forgotten deities who first forged life from essence, and the hidden truth behind the art of alchemy itself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013510/extras/3fb51bba3878619fd0cf19381980980a.poster.avif?t=1760028105\" width=654 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013510/extras/3fb51bba3878619fd0cf19381980980a.webm?t=1760028105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4013510?t=1760028105","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013510/c57bb8fa226bff18a85f80e366c315c64fa23590/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760028105","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013510/6fa6bab2da0dfc064586f8d677fbc84f73fca5cc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760028105","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013510/6fa6bab2da0dfc064586f8d677fbc84f73fca5cc/ca