class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORLD TO EXPLORE\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through diverse, hand-crafted environments, from sunny beaches to haunted graveyards, each filled with secrets to find, resources to gather, and charismatic characters to befriend (or battle).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013510/extras/36c5373fa7e35ff3d33dc22d9e90d32e.poster.avif?t=1760028105\" width=654 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013510/extras/36c5373fa7e35ff3d33dc22d9e90d32e.webm?t=1760028105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A HEARTFUL ADVENTURE\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a world-shaping lore where the lines between gods, monsters, and alchemists blur. Discover the ancient myths of creation, the forgotten deities who first forged life from essence, and the hidden truth behind the art of alchemy itself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013510/extras/3fb51bba3878619fd0cf19381980980a.poster.avif?t=1760028105\" width=654 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013510/extras/3fb51bba3878619fd0cf19381980980a.webm?t=1760028105\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Team Metacarpo"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013510/945698075b3eaeb855fc1ca58d05711cc6017165/header.jpg?t=1760028105","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00